# Auto-generated hook artifact — captures session activity, no source of truth
**/state/session_log.md

# Playwright output. Both directories are generated by a test run — the CI job
# uploads playwright-report/ as an artifact on failure — and neither was
# ignored, so the first local `pnpm --filter @forgemsg/web test:e2e` after the
# smoke suite stopped being opt-in offered a trace.zip and a screenshot for
# commit. Found exactly that way.
apps/web/test-results/
apps/web/playwright-report/
